  displayNameTurkish: "Alet sand\u0131\u011F\u0131"
  descriptionTurkish: "18 mm ladinden a\xE7\u0131k alet sand\u0131\u011F\u0131: kavelal\u0131
    ve tutkall\u0131 taban, \xE7ivili yanlar, vidal\u0131 sap; z\u0131mparal\u0131
    ve ya\u011Fl\u0131."
  tipsTurkish:
  - "Yanlar\u0131 (100 mm) ve sap\u0131 (45 mm) boyuna kes: testere elde, Q boyuna
    kesim modu, tekerlek geni\u015Fli\u011Fi ayarlar."
  - "Ba\u015Flar tabana: kavela deliklerini a\xE7, kavelalar\u0131 tutkalla tak,
    i\u015Fkencedeki ba\u011Flant\u0131n\u0131n kurumas\u0131n\u0131 bekle."
  - "Yanlar\u0131n u\xE7lar\u0131na yak\u0131n \xE7iviler k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131
    noktalar: \xF6nce delik a\xE7, yoksa yanlar \xE7atlar."
  - "Tam \xFCcret i\xE7in her par\xE7ay\u0131 \xF6nce z\u0131mparala, sonra ya\u011Fla."
